<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani stocks end down, seen weak.</title>
<headline>Pakistani stocks end down, seen weak.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani stocks will keep the market under selling pressure,&quot; a dealer at Ali Hussain Rajabali said.</p>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchang led gainers 130 to 76. Turnover rose to 20.20 million shares from 15.88 million on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
